    "# Resume Training from best_model (1).pt on Kaggle\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook resumes training from the specific checkpoint `/Volumes/data&proj/konkani/best_model (1).pt`\n",
    "\n",
    "## Prerequisites:\n",
    "1. Upload `best_model (1).pt` as a Kaggle dataset\n",
    "2. Upload your model code (`konkanivani_asr.py`) as a dataset\n",
    "3. Upload your training data as a dataset"
